{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2022-12-14 16:58:00', 'title': 'HOLLAND AMERICA LINE NAMED EXCLUSIVE CRUISE LINE PARTNER OF THE PROFESSIONAL PICKLEBALL ASSOCIATION', 'text': 'PICKLEBALL COURTS, COMPLIMENTARY LESSONS AND TUTORIALS TO BE FEATURED FLEETWIDE \xa0 SEATTLE , DEC. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- A LEADER IN CRUISING IS TEAMING UP WITH THE LEADER OF THE FASTEST GROWING SPORT IN THE U.S., THANKS TO AN EXCITING NEW PARTNERSHIP. HOLLAND AMERICA LINE HAS BEEN EXCLUSIVELY NAMED AS THE OFFICIAL CRUISE LINE OF THE PROFESSIONAL PICKLEBALL ASSOCIATION (PPA) AND IS COMMITTED TO EXPANDING ITS PICKLEBALL EXPERIENCE AT SEA FOR GUESTS.'}{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2022-12-14 09:15:00', 'title': 'CARNIVAL CORPORATION & PLC TO PROVIDE FOURTH QUARTER 2022 BUSINESS UPDATE', 'text': 'MIAMI , DEC. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CARNIVAL CORPORATION & PLC (NYSE/LSE: CCL; NYSE: CUK) HAS SCHEDULED A CONFERENCE CALL WITH ANALYSTS FOR WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 21, 2022, AT 10 A.M. (EST); 3 P.M.'}